00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
You stole my open.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I was about to say,

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:15.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Not that the world
